      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXORBITANT (2) had won two in a row before finishing second (29.45) last time at Gosford. Has never missed the frame at the trip from five starts. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Good form should continue. LUCKY BISCUIT (7) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts two wins and two placings. Was out of placings last time (30.96) at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5, finishing seventh and beaten 15 lengths. Looks a key chance on best figures. ZIPPING LUMIERE (8) is a consistent type who is having his first try here. Comes into this a winner last time from box one where he scored by 3.5 lengths at Wentworth Park (29.74). Some good form is emerging from his last run. In great form and can continue his winning ways. IRINKA WAYNE (1) has been freshened for this and can hit the frame.",
